yle="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=23;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1026.0" y="206" width="838" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="1010" y="195" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1010" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="795" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;공통 후속 처리: source / 권한 / 입력 세대 검사 → Publication Control → Interaction Manager 실제 표시/재생 → receipt&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="811" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;확인 질문은 별도 admission으로 현재 입력 해소를 기다리지 않고 제시 / 발화 시작은 업무 취소 완료가 아님&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="840" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="875" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="875" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;정확성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="883" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;의미 판단은 41과 동일 / 중앙에서 세대 / 대기 참조 연결&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="883" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;같은 판단과 검사 / 단계 간 참조 / Join 오류 관리 필요&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="883" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="909" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="909" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;응답성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="917" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;완료 회수 / 다음 지시 경로 / 중앙 전이 비용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="917" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;조건 충족 소비자 직접 활성화 / 채널 / Join 비용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="917" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="943" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="943" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;모델 사용 비용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="951" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;같은 의미 / 응답 job이면 동일 / 폐기 / 재시도 포함&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="951" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;같은 job이면 동일 / 중복 생산 / 폐기 호출 포함&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="951" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="977" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="977" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;변경 / 메모리&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="985" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;조정 규칙 중앙 변경 / 하나의 진행 상태&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="985" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;단계 조합 국소 변경 조건 / 여러 Window / 채널 상태&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="985" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;미선정 / 미측정. A도 비동기 / 우선순위 / 동시 실행. B의 사건 채널만으로 정확성 / 속도 우위를 보장하지 않는다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1032" width="1840" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Module 구조와 후속 실행 자료를 비교 / 준비 완료 / 내부 접수 / 외부 접수 / 실제 전달을 구별 / 수치 우열은 측정 후 판단&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=14;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1060" width="1840" height="18.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend44_0" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="47" y="342" width="86" height="447" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend44_1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="49.0" y="351" width="82" height="19.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend44_2" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="5